Gating. Every branch is gated on gSohVRFpActive, which overlay 0041 only ever
raises inside VR gameplay; the flat window, the 3D panel and every iPhone build
see vanilla plus one integer test. __IOS__-only; the macOS build compiles none
of it (gSohVRFpActive is a weak zero there).

