+ * Suppressing the auto-use is the honest fix, and it is deliberately not
+ * boomerang-only: the same free use makes a bow SELECT loose an arrow a few
+ * ticks later (func_808351D4's fire test is `unk_836 > 0 &&
+ * !sHeldItemButtonIsHeldDown`, and after a select the button is not held),
+ * which costs ammo for nothing. With it suppressed the equip press does
+ * exactly one thing -- it puts the item in the hand -- and every use comes
+ * from the trigger afterwards, which is the rule the whole VR profile is
+ * built on.
