+/* SOH_IOS (0042 rev12, VR R11 review fix): VANILLA'S COMBO ESCALATION,
+ * COUNTED IN ONE PLACE.
+ *
+ * func_80833A20 plays the HEAVY pair when this->unk_845 >= 3 -- the third
+ * hit of a chain -- and unk_845 is maintained by func_80837948, which is
+ * inside the authored attack machine rev5 retires for a covered weapon. So
+ * in VR that field never advances and rev11's sohHard was a literal 0 at
+ * both call sites: the heavy pair could not play at all.
+ *
+ * This is vanilla's arithmetic, unchanged --
+ *
+ *     if ((arg2 != meleeWeaponAnimation) || !(unk_845 < 3)) unk_845 = 0;
+ *     unk_845++;                     ... heavy at unk_845 >= 3
+ *
+ * -- with vanilla's chain test "the animation differs" replaced by the only
+ * test VR can make, "the chain window has expired". The window is seven
+ * game ticks, the same one the B stab already opens for its damage: attacks
