+/* SOH_IOS (0042 rev5, VR R7 verdict 4): MOTION COMBAT COVERS THIS WEAPON.
+ * Donor VrCombat_MeleeCovered (VrSwing.cpp:1007-1015), and it is the gate
+ * on the whole authored-attack suppression below.
+ *
+ * the user, 2026-09-04, wearing it: "i swung my arm but it didn't do a true
+ * attack with the sword... the animation when you attack doesn't show the
+ * sword actually attacking forward, it just shows a swish wind animation
+ * while the sword is FIXED to your hand."
